OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe third visit is to The White
OL,7,     FHouse in Swansea, owned by Lloyd
OL,8,     Fand Marta, where guests James and
OL,9,     FJessica have a toilet encounter
OL,10,     Fthey'll never forget...
OL,11,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FThe final visit is to Jacobs
OL,13,     FPlough in Bicester, Oxfordshire,
OL,14,     Frun by manager Duncan and bar
OL,15,     Fsupervisor Ryan, who like to mix
OL,16,     Fbusiness with banter. But Lloyd
OL,17,     Fand Marta pick the place apart.
