OL,5,G0005 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FGraham, who's 50, is rushed to
OL,7,     FKing's after having a suspected
OL,8,     Fheart attack. Pat, who's 71, is
OL,9,     Fbrought in after her husband Bill
OL,10,     Ffound her unconscious at home.
OL,11,G0105 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,12,     FAir ambulance teams rush to help
OL,13,     FBill after his car flips over.
OL,14,     FMalcolm, who has had a cardiac
OL,15,     Farrest, is put under emergency
OL,16,     Fanaesthetic on a hospital helipad.
